---
name: cameragr-no-self-retouch
description: "Koco visuals come from GPT, not from me — every new screen is a skeuomorphic GPT-drawn object (my concept), never code-drawn or web/menu-like; no retouching of art, no code-drawn parts"
metadata:
  node_type: memory
  type: feedback
  originSessionId: a7b155bd-1e03-4921-b49c-c714f27f4dc7
  modified: 2026-11-20T03:19:42.457Z
